# Line-ending policy. Windows checkouts with autocrlf materialise text
# files with CRLF, which breaks line-anchored tooling (the release.yml
# version-sync perl is the case that shipped: run 35409753696). Pin
# manifests to LF on every OS, every checkout. Deliberately scoped:
# no broad `* eol=lf` here — patch files and friends have history
# (see scripts/bootstrap.sh's CRLF patch ladder and commit 3479e64).
*.toml text eol=lf
